# Domain Types

All types shared across UI, API routes, services, and the site renderer live in `src/lib/types/`.

| Kind | Location | Example |
| ---- | -------- | ------- |
| Enums / status unions | `src/lib/types/enums.ts` | `SiteStatus`, `BookingChannel` |
| Domain entities | `src/lib/types/<domain>.ts` | `Site`, `Room`, `QuestionnaireAnswers` |
| Generated site content | `src/lib/types/site-content.ts` | `SiteContent`, `HomePageContent` |
| API shapes | `src/lib/types/api.ts` | `ApiResponse<T>`, `GenerateSiteRequest` |

- Drizzle-inferred row types come from `src/db/schema.ts` for DB layer only.
- API request/response shapes use domain types — not raw Drizzle rows in route responses.
- Re-export from `src/lib/types/index.ts` for convenient imports.

**Don't** duplicate types in components or duplicate API shapes in route files.
